Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; 25 - Microsoft Store apps may not run in the background.
; Store apps (weather, mail, news and others) otherwise keep refreshing while you play.
; This is the old global switch "Let apps run in the background"; on the newest Windows 11 builds
; the per-app setting in Settings - Apps may take over, so the effect varies. Desktop programs
; such as Steam, Discord and your game launchers are NOT affected.
; Undo: menu 7, then 25.
[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\BackgroundAccessApplications]
"GlobalUserDisabled"=dword:00000001
